flowchart TD
    User([User taste profile]) --> Main[src/main.py<br/>CLI runner]
    CSV[(data/songs.csv)] --> Load[load_songs]
    Load --> Main
    Main --> Agent[AgenticRecommender.run<br/>src/agent.py]

    subgraph Loop [Agentic workflow: plan - act - check - fix]
        direction TB
        Plan[PLAN<br/>sanitise input, clamp<br/>out-of-range values,<br/>pick starting strategy] --> Act
        Act[ACT<br/>recommend_songs with<br/>current weights +<br/>diversity penalty] --> Check
        Check{CHECK<br/>relevance? diversity?<br/>valid output?}
        Check -- issues found --> Fix[FIX<br/>adjust weights /<br/>raise diversity penalty]
        Fix --> Act
        Check -- passes OR iteration cap --> Done[Return recommendations<br/>+ trace + warnings]
    end

    Agent --> Plan
    Act -.calls.-> Rec[recommender.py<br/>score_song / recommend_songs]
    Done --> Output[Ranked songs, reasons,<br/>agent trace, guardrail notes]
    Loop -.logs each step.-> Log[[logging: music_agent]]
